<section class="architecture architecture-v112" id="how-it-works">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head arch112-head">
<div class="section-label">How It Works</div>
<h2>Connect Employees to Workforce Platforms.</h2>
<p>One collection foundation. Built for Workday and software partners.</p>
</div>
<div class="arch112-map">
<article class="arch112-foundation">
<div class="arch112-kicker">CAPTURE</div>
<h3>Flexible Employee Capture</h3>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="arch112-device">
<img alt="" src="assets/ultima-combo.png"/>
</div>
<div class="arch112-methods">
<span>Ultima Time Clocks</span><span>Kiosk</span><span>Mobile</span><span>Web</span><span>IVR</span>
</div>
</article>
<div class="arch112-paths">
<div class="arch112-path-label">TWO INTEGRATION PATHS</div>
<article class="arch112-path workday-path">
<div class="arch112-route-tag">WORKDAY</div>
<div aria-label="Bi-directional exchange" class="arch112-bi left">⇄</div>
<div class="arch112-path-copy">
<small>PROCESS &amp; CONNECT</small>
<div class="cirrusdcs-inline-logo"><img alt="CirrusDCS" src="assets/CIRRUS-DCS.svg" /></div>
<p>Workday-specific cloud layer.</p>
<div class="arch112-chips"><span>Synchronize</span><span>Manage</span><span>Integrate</span></div>
</div>
<div aria-label="Bi-directional exchange" class="arch112-bi right">⇄</div>
</article>
<article class="arch112-path partner-path">
<div class="arch112-route-tag">SOFTWARE PARTNERS</div>
<div aria-label="Bi-directional exchange" class="arch112-bi left">⇄</div>
<div class="arch112-path-copy">
<small>PROCESS &amp; CONNECT</small>
<div class="cirrusconnect-inline-logo"><img alt="CirrusConnect" src="assets/CirrusConnect-logo.svg" /></div>
<p>Partner-ready connectivity layer.</p>
<div class="arch112-chips"><span>Applications</span><span>APIs &amp; SDKs</span><span>Device Management</span></div>
</div>
<div aria-label="Bi-directional exchange" class="arch112-bi right">⇄</div>
</article>
</div>
<div class="arch112-destinations">
<article class="arch112-destination workday-dest">
<div class="workday-dest-kicker">Workforce Platform</div>
<small>DELIVER</small>
<div aria-label="Workday" class="workday-destination">
<img alt="Workday" class="workday-logo" src="assets/logo-web-workday.svg"/>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="workday-arc"></div>
<div class="workday-word">workday<sup>®</sup></div>

</div>
</article>
<article class="arch112-destination partner-dest">
<div class="partner-dest-kicker">Partner Platform</div>
<small>DELIVER</small>
<div class="dest-platform"><img src="assets/wfm-hcm-logo.svg" alt="WFM / HCM platform" /></div>
</article>
</div>
</div>
<div class="arch112-flow-note"><strong>Bi-directional by design.</strong><span>Workforce context moves to the collection layer. Time &amp; labor events move back to the platform.</span></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="why-section" id="why">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="why-intro">
<div class="section-label">Why ZKTeco WFM</div>
<h2>From Punch to Accurate Time &amp; Labor Data</h2>
</div>
<div class="data-journey">
<div class="journey-rail">
<article class="journey-stage">
<div class="journey-node"><span class="journey-icon"><img alt="" src="assets/Identify.svg"/></span></div><span class="journey-arrow">→</span>
<h3>Identify</h3>
<p>Confirm identity with biometrics, badges or mobile credentials.</p>
</article>
<article class="journey-stage">
<div class="journey-node"><span class="journey-icon"><img alt="" src="assets/capture-icon.svg"/></span></div><span class="journey-arrow">→</span>
<h3>Capture</h3>
<p>Record time, labor, transfers and attestations where work happens.</p>
</article>
<article class="journey-stage">
<div class="journey-node"><span class="journey-icon"><img alt="" src="assets/validate-icon.svg"/></span></div><span class="journey-arrow">→</span>
<h3>Validate</h3>
<p>Apply rules and exception logic before data moves downstream.</p>
</article>
<article class="journey-stage">
<div class="journey-node"><span class="journey-icon"><img alt="" src="assets/connect-icon.svg"/></span></div><span class="journey-arrow">→</span>
<h3>Connect</h3>
<p>Keep devices, cloud services and integrations synchronized.</p>
</article>
<article class="journey-stage">
<div class="journey-node"><span class="journey-icon"><img alt="" src="assets/Deliver-icon.svg"/></span></div>
<h3>Deliver</h3>
<p>Send accurate time and labor data to Workday, WFM and HCM platforms.</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
<div class="why-close"><strong>The Punch Is Only the Beginning.</strong><span>What happens next determines the quality of your <em>time and labor data.</em></span></div>
</div>
</section>
